BOSS Scorchion Dark Shamans Torture
    Events
        Time - BossScorchionTortureTimer expires
    Conditions
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Number of units in BossScorchionDarkShamans) Greater than 0
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet BossScorchionDarkShaman = (Random unit from BossScorchionDarkShamans)
                Set VariableSet CV = (Custom value of BossScorchionDarkShaman)
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        IsUnitAlive[CV] Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Order BossScorchionDarkShaman to Attack Once BossScorchion
                        Wait 0.50 seconds
                        Unit - Make BossScorchion face BossScorchionDarkShaman over 0.20 seconds
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                (Random integer number between 1 and 5) Equal to 5
                            Then - Actions
                                Wait (Random real number between 0.50 and 1.00) seconds
                                Unit - Make BossScorchion face (Random unit from BossScorchionDarkShamans) over 0.20 seconds
                            Else - Actions
                    Else - Actions
            Else - Actions
        Countdown Timer - Start BossScorchionTortureTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in (Random real number between 1.00 and 4.00) seconds
